          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:99406c980dcb181ceb713be1ad274ca686a647e3ac2afb50d031495555e308ec:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2c43b5311acc47ee9d484447edca9b51",
      "statement": "The Go signaling server validates hub-endpoint query parameters before the WebSocket handshake via the shared validateHubCreateParams helper: a missing/empty/whitespace id or non-JSON hubMetadata is rejected with HTTP 400 and an oversized id/hubMetadata with 413; peerMetadata is size- and shape-checked at Upgrade. An empty-id request can no longer create a junk hub under the empty-string key and oversized or malformed metadata is not stored or re-broadcast.",
